      "question": "How do you say **I didn't come**?",
      "options": ["gelmedim", "gelmeýärin", "geldim däl", "gelmediň"],
      "optionsLang": "tk",
      "answer": 0,
      "why": {
        "1": "*gelmeýärin* is the present: **I'm not coming**.",
        "2": "With verbs, **not** is the ending *-mA*, not *däl*: *gelmedim*.",
        "3": "*gelmediň* is **you didn't come**."
      },
      "explain": "*gel-* + *-me* (not) + *-di* (past) + *-m* (I): *gelmedim*."
    },
